# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*~

# ── Obsidian per-user UI state (the rest of .obsidian/ is tracked) ──
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache

# ── Safety snapshots (local recovery only) ─────────────────────────
**/_generator/_snapshots/
**/Presentation/build/_engine-snapshots/

# ── Generator scratch (media-map.json, spot-check PNGs) ────────────
**/Presentation/build/_generator/tmp/

# ── Large binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The source .pptx is the MASTER input and is NOT reproducible. Back it up
# outside git (or move it to Git LFS). It is ignored here only to keep the
# repo lean — "ignored" does not mean "safe to lose".
10 - Courses/*/Source Deck/*.pptx
10 - Courses/*/Source Deck/*.ppt

# Extracted slide media (~160 MB) — regenerable from the .pptx via
# extract-media.ps1. Track separately or via Git LFS if it must be versioned.
10 - Courses/*/Presentation/build/assets/img/

# Source Library reference PDFs (~680 MB) — static inputs. Back up
# separately or use Git LFS.
20 - Source Library/**/*.pdf
20 - Source Library/**/*.docx
20 - Source Library/**/*.lnk

# Exception, 2026-09-14, widened same day: the standing shared Source
# Library shelf every published course's 📚 panel shows — the same 21
# documents (5 primary + 16 across 3 instruction-manual columns) already
# curated in 14101's own library block, matching it exactly rather than
# scoping down per course. 53MB total, no LFS needed. Still a real, named
# subset — the rest of the ~680MB Source Library stays ignored above.
!20 - Source Library/Handbooks & Sourcebooks/Control Valve Handbook/Control Valve Handbook - Sixth Edition.pdf
!20 - Source Library/Handbooks & Sourcebooks/Industry Specific Sourcebooks/Control Valve Sourcebook - Oil & Gas.pdf
!20 - Source Library/Handbooks & Sourcebooks/Industry Specific Sourcebooks/Control Valve Sourcebook - Power & Severe Service.pdf
!20 - Source Library/Handbooks & Sourcebooks/Industry Specific Sourcebooks/Control Valve Sourcebook - Refining.pdf
!20 - Source Library/Handbooks & Sourcebooks/Industry Specific Sourcebooks/Control Valve Sourcebook - Pulp & Paper.pdf
